urts are drop-in only.","short_summary":"A Market-neighborhood park with an interpretive walk and Heritage Hall.","evidence_claim":"The City says Heritage Park has Heritage Hall and gardens, tennis courts, a play area, an interpretive walk, and a grass field.","source_url":"https://www.kirklandwa.gov/Government/Departments/Parks-and-Community-Services/Find-a-Park/Heritage-Park","source_title":"Heritage Park — City of Kirkland","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":47.6798486,"longitude":-122.2126982,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City-listed park hours are sunrise to 11 PM; Heritage Hall rentals have separate terms.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"waverly-beach-park","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Waverly Beach Park","title":"Waverly Beach Park: carved benches","subtitle":"Waverly Way corridor","notes":"Continue along Waverly Way to see the carved cedar bench series and waterfront dock; check current water-quality updates before any swimming plan.","short_summary":"A waterfront park with carved public art, dock, and beach facilities.","evidence_claim":"The City identifies Waverly Beach Park’s carved cedar bench series, dock, playground, picnic areas, and swimming beach.","source_url":"https://www.kirklandwa.gov/Government/Departments/Parks-and-Community-Services/Find-a-Park/Waverly-Beach-Park","source_title":"Waverly Beach Park — City of Kirkland","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":47.6869314,"longitude":-122.2166368,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"City-listed park hours are sunrise to 10 PM; swimming conditions and lifeguard availability can change.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"kirkland-arts-center","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Kirkland Arts Center","title":"Kirkland Arts Center: gallery and classes","subtitle":"Market Street corridor","notes":"Stop at the Market Street gallery during posted exhibition hours, or browse the official workshop listings for an age-appropriate class before registering.","short_summary":"A Market Street arts center with a gallery and visual-arts workshops.","evidence_claim":"Kirkland Arts Center lists its location at 620 Market Street and invites visitors to view its professional, non-commercial gallery or take visual-arts classes.","source_url":"https://kirklandartscenter.org/plan-your-visit/","source_title":"Plan Your Visit — Kirkland Arts Center","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Gallery and class hours vary; some specific workshops are restricted to adults, so review the individual listing.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Several destinations are in downtown Kirkland rather than immediately adjacent to campus; verify travel routing and current access conditions before leaving campus."]}],"warnings":[]}
